extraction_notes: "WB30 D-Bees of North America printed 124-127 (cache p125-p128), every number read off 200 dpi renders; the entry opens below the Loak on printed 124 and ends at Rivals and Enemies on printed 127, above the Lyn-Srial heading (the brief gave 124-126; Hand to Hand, psionics, equipment and money are on 127). Heading Loronoids - Optional Player Character or NPC. A mutant from Achilles, not a D-Bee. || CATEGORY: a complete R.C.C. that takes no O.C.C. (Available O.C.C.s: None); not expressible as occ_restrictions, a restriction line says so. || XP: Use the Military Specialist experience table. No Rifts class named Military Specialist is in the catalog (only Heroes Unlimited''s hu-edu-military-specialist and China 2''s geofront-military-specialist, neither the named table), so no xp_table is stored; reported for a decision. || POOLS: Hit Points P.E. plus 1D6 per level. Base S.D.C. 3D6+10 stored as sdc_base because the R.C.C. is the whole class (the Condoroid convention, the same Achilles mutant family), so no men_of_arms line. P.P.E. 3D4. Horror Factor not applicable. Money 3D4x100 credits. || ATTRIBUTES as printed; Spd 3D6 running, 4D6+28 flying (ability text). || BONUSES: +2 Perception, +1 strike, +2 parry, +1 dodge, +2 pull punch, +3 roll stored; +4 to dodge when flying is conditional, ability text. || PSIONICS: at first level Clairvoyance, Empathy, Mind Block Auto-Defense, Mind Wipe, Object Read (Psychometry; printed Object Read), Remote Viewing, Sense Time, Telepathy and Total Recall, plus 1D4 Sensitive powers (stored as 4 with the roll-and-take-that-many note), plus one Sensitive at levels 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15; the Super powers Empathic Transmission at 4, Hypnotic Suggestion at 8 and Psychic Omni-Sight at 12 as named-list schedule entries. Master Psionic. I.S.P. M.E. + 2D4x10+10, +2D6 per level. || SKILLS: catalog base plus printed bonus. Language: Native Tongue Spanish 98% as Language: Spanish 98 and Literacy: Native Tongue Spanish as Literacy: Native Language 98 (the Condoroid''s convention). Language: Other American and three of choice (+20%): a choose-4 Language: Other at +20% whose note names American as one pick; Literacy: Other American and two of choice (+20%) likewise as a choose-3 (Literacy: Other is a placeholder row that may not be granted by name). Gambling (Standard) 30+10. Imitate Voices & Sounds 42+16. Mathematics: Basic 98% and Advanced 78% +2% per level from Intuitive Math. W.P. Blunt or Knife and W.P. Energy Pistol or Rifle as choose-1 groups. Hand to Hand: Basic changes to Expert at the cost of two Secondary Skills: stored costs expert 2 (the app counts the picks; the book spends secondary skills since the race has no related skills). R.C.C. Related Skills: none. SECONDARY: three at level one plus two at levels 3, 6, 9, 12 and 15. || EQUIPMENT: Vibro-Knife or Neural Mace; weapons-matching-w-p-skills; 1D4+1 E-Clips; light or medium custom or patchwork M.D.C. armor (patchwork 32 to 55 M.D.C., non-environmental) as personalized-light-or-medium-mdc-body-armor (judgement); hand radio with scrambler as walkie-talkie; gas mask, survival kit, canteen, food-rations (one week), hammock, lighter and matches, mechanical pencil, handheld computer, pocket mirror. No catalog rows, not stored and not statted: hip flask of rum, 1D6+1 cigars, medium or large satchel, medium shoulder bag, journal, 1D4 markers, bottle opener; optional camera, translator and jewelry. || NOT STORED: size 4 feet to 5 feet 5 inches, weight 60 to 90 lbs, life span 4D4+130, eggs, slave value 3D6x10,000, habitat, allies and enemies; GM Notes."
